<speak>
<s>From <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news, this is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">04042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>American special forces have crossed into Iranian territory to rescue a downed weapons systems officer — the first known US ground presence inside Iran during this war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Iran shot down two American warplanes on Friday, just forty-eight hours after President Trump declared total victory, and Iranian militias are now hunting the missing crew member.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>What began as an air campaign has pulled American boots onto Iranian soil, and nobody in Washington will say what happens if the pilot is captured.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan is hosting US-Iran ceasefire talks this week while its military shells villages across the Afghan border in Kunar and Nooristan.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Islamabad frames the cross-border strikes against ethnic Gujjar communities as counterterrorism — the same language every state uses when bombing people who can't fight back.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>American negotiators sitting in Islamabad haven't said a word about the bombardment happening a few hundred kilometers away.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Hungary, sixty-five percent of voters under thirty now poll against Viktor Orbán — a generation that's spent its entire political life under one man's rule.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Fidesz controls eighty percent of traditional media, but social platforms have let opposition voices reach voters who never knew a Hungary before democratic backsliding.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Whether youth turnout can overcome Orbán's gerrymandered electoral map will be known on April twelfth.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia's tanker Anatoly Kolodkin delivered seven hundred thousand barrels of oil to Havana — and Trump, who'd banned all oil shipments to Cuba, waved it through.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Three days later, Cuba released two thousand and ten prisoners, a sequence that looks less like coincidence and more like negotiation by oil tanker.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The sticking point is Senator Rubio, who's spent his career pledging to unseat the Castros — and Cuba's negotiating team includes one.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Nigeria's northwest, bandits have overrun communities across Sokoto state while the federal government in Abuja ignored repeated appeals for help.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Senator Ibrahim Lamido quit the ruling <sub alias="A P C">APC</sub> over what he calls a complete failure to protect his constituents — a rare act of political defection driven by conscience rather than calculation.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>He hasn't named his next party, but allies are already moving to the African Democratic Congress.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India has resumed importing Iranian crude for the first time in seven years, openly defying the sanctions regime that kept the world's third-largest oil buyer away from its cheapest supplier.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Washington's temporary waiver last month — issued after the <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="streɪt əv hɔrˈmuːz">Strait of Hormuz</phoneme> closed and crude hit a hundred dollars a barrel — gave New Delhi legal cover.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sanctions regimes hold until the cost of compliance exceeds the cost of defiance, and for India, that threshold just broke.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Five EU finance ministers from Germany, Italy, Spain, Portugal, and Austria are demanding a windfall tax on energy profits as the Iran war enriches producers and bleeds consumers.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Their legal template is the twenty twenty-two solidarity levy imposed during the Russia-Ukraine price shock, which means the mechanism already exists.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Whether Commissioner Hoekstra can hold EU cohesion as southern members slide toward recession will define the bloc's next quarter.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>For the first time, central banks worldwide hold more gold than US Treasuries in their foreign reserves — a quiet inversion of the order that's underpinned global finance for eighty years.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China, Russia, and Gulf states have been stacking gold for years, accelerating every time Washington weaponized the dollar through sanctions or asset freezes.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>No major central bank has announced new Treasury purchases, and the silence is the signal.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukrainian drones struck a rubber plant and fertilizer hub in Samara, setting fire to a node in the industrial network that feeds Russia's war economy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The campaign against Samara and neighboring Togliatti is now systematic — targeting the chemical production that sustains both ammunition manufacturing and agriculture.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A separate strike hit a commercial vessel in the Sea of Azov, extending Ukraine's war into Russian shipping lanes.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Swedish researchers found that a simple spruce wood membrane filters ninety percent of nanoplastics from water in a single pass — no synthetic materials, no chemical treatment, just the natural microstructure of softwood.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The elegance is hard to ignore: the microplastic crisis was created by synthetic materials, and a piece of wood outperforms them as a filter.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Whether spruce membranes can scale from a lab bench to a municipal water plant remains the open question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Buenos Aires identified three druggable escape routes that explain why some luminal breast cancers resist standard antiprogestin therapy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The tumors overexpress a growth factor called FGF two, which activates the androgen receptor and Wnt signaling pathways — essentially three back doors the cancer uses when the front door is locked.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Existing drugs blocked all three routes in mice, turning treatment-resistant cancer into something targetable.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A study in Nature found that a key Parkinson's gene mutation damages oligodendrocytes — the brain's insulation cells — not just the dopamine neurons researchers have targeted for decades.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The implication is profound: the disease may disable entire neural circuits before a single neuron dies, which means treatments aimed at preserving dopamine alone are arriving too late.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Oligodendrocytes are now an untested drug target for a disease affecting ten million people worldwide.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Zimbabwe's rollout of lenacapavir — a breakthrough HIV drug requiring just one injection every six months — has stalled after US funding cuts halted supply before the program could scale.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The drug was supposed to transform prevention in a country where daily pill regimens fail millions of people.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>If supply gaps persist, interrupted treatment risks creating drug-resistant strains that won't stop at Zimbabwe's borders.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The <sub alias="Federal Aviation Administration">FAA</sub> imposed flight restrictions around Immigration and Customs Enforcement operations, and the Electronic Frontier Foundation says it's airspace regulation repurposed as press censorship.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Minnesota journalist has sued on First Amendment grounds, arguing that banning drones near deportation raids is designed to prevent documentation, not protect safety.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The case will test whether technical infrastructure rules can function as speech restrictions shielded from constitutional review.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Google demonstrated that a quantum computer could crack a Bitcoin wallet in nine minutes once a public key is exposed — just under Bitcoin's ten-minute transaction confirmation window.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nearly seven million Bitcoin already have permanently exposed public keys, making them vulnerable the moment quantum hardware reaches sufficient scale.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bitcoin, unlike Ethereum, has no post-quantum cryptography roadmap — leaving a trillion-dollar network waiting for a lock it can't change.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing from <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>